  "excerpt": "彌陀救度眾生的法船，隨時停泊在煩惱暴流之津，但眾生沉迷五欲，或驕慢自恃，不肯登此法船，致令彌陀久候無人。\n  \n  經言：\n   必得超絕去，往生安樂國；\n   橫截五惡道，惡道自然閉。\n   升道無窮極，易往而無人；\n",
  "bodyHtml": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://plb.tw/upload/_userfilesimages/%e9%87%8e%e6%b8%a1%e7%84%a1%e4%ba%ba%e8%88%9f%e8%87%aa%e6%a9%ab-%e5%9c%96%ef%bc%9a%e8%b1%90%e5%ad%90%e6%84%b7.JPG\" />　</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>彌陀救度眾生的法船，隨時停泊在煩惱暴流之津，但眾生沉迷五欲，或驕慢自恃，不肯登此法船，致令彌陀久候無人。</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p> 經言：</p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"color:#000080\">&nbsp; 必得超絕去，往生安樂國；</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"color:#000080\">&nbsp; 橫截五惡道，惡道自然閉。</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"color:#000080\">&nbsp; 升道無窮極，易往而無人；</span></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"color:#000080\">&nbsp; 其國不逆違，自然之所牽。</span></span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2019年7月11日</p> <p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>圖：豐子愷</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align:right\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>文：釋淨宗</strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>原文出自唐代韋應物的《滁州西澗》<br /> &nbsp;</p> <p>獨憐幽草澗邊生，上有黃鸝深樹鳴。<br /> 春潮帶雨晚來急，野渡無人舟自橫。</p>",
